<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>金银铜锡价格月报｜{{ year }}年{{ month_name }}月</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            background: #F7F5F2;
            color: #333333;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 15px;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 520px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 16px 14px 40px;
        }

        /* ── 页面头部 ── */
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 28px 16px 18px;
        }
        .header .icon {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2D3748;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .header .month-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 8px;
            padding: 4px 18px;
            background: #EDF2F7;
            color: #4A5568;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .header .report-date {
            margin-top: 6px;
            color: #A0AEC0;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* ── 一句话总览 ── */
        .overview-line {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 14px 10px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EBF4FF 0%, #F0F5FF 100%);
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2B6CB0;
        }

        /* ── 重点卡片 ── */
        .highlight-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .highlight-card {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 14px 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #FFFFFF;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            text-align: center;
        }
        .highlight-card .label {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #A0AEC0;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .highlight-card .metal-name {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }
        .highlight-card .chg-value {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .up { color: #E53E3E; }
        .down { color: #38A169; }
        .flat { color: #718096; }

        /* ── 金属卡片 ── */
        .section-title {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2D3748;
            margin: 22px 0 10px 2px;
            padding-left: 10px;
            border-left: 4px solid #D4A017;
        }

        .metal-card {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px 16px 14px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .metal-card .card-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .metal-card .card-header .metal-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .metal-card .card-header .status-tag {
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .tag-strong-up   { background: #FED7D7; color: #C53030; }
        .tag-mild-up     { background: #FEFCBF; color: #975A16; }
        .tag-flat        { background: #EDF2F7; color: #4A5568; }
        .tag-mild-down   { background: #FEFCBF; color: #975A16; }
        .tag-strong-down { background: #C6F6D5; color: #276749; }
        .tag-cont-up     { background: #FFF5F5; color: #E53E3E; }
        .tag-cont-down   { background: #F0FFF4; color: #38A169; }

        .metal-card .price-line {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .metal-card .price-main {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #1A202C;
        }
        .metal-card .price-unit {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #A0AEC0;
            margin-left: 4px;
        }

        .metal-card .changes {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4px 16px;
        }
        .metal-card .change-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 14px;
            padding: 3px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dotted #EDF2F7;
        }
        .metal-card .change-item .chg-label {
            color: #718096;
        }
        .metal-card .change-item .chg-val {
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* ── 图表 ── */
        .chart-section {
            margin: 18px 0 10px;
        }
        .chart-section img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #FFFFFF;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }

        /* ── 对比区域 ── */
        .compare-box {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .compare-box .compare-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dotted #EDF2F7;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .compare-box .compare-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .compare-box .compare-label {
            color: #4A5568;
        }
        .compare-box .compare-val {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .compare-box .compare-sentence {
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            background: #FFFFF0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #744210;
        }

        /* ── 提醒 / 小结 ── */
        .alert-box {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .alert-box .alert-item {
            padding: 6px 0 6px 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #C53030;
            position: relative;
        }
        .alert-box .alert-item::before {
            content: "⚠️";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
        }
        .alert-box .no-alert {
            color: #38A169;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .summary-box {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .summary-box .summary-item {
            padding: 5px 0 5px 16px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #2D3748;
            position: relative;
        }
        .summary-box .summary-item::before {
            content: "·";
            position: absolute;
            left: 2px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #D4A017;
        }

        /* ── 数据说明 ── */
        .footer-notes {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .footer-notes h3 {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #718096;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .footer-notes ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .footer-notes li {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #A0AEC0;
            padding: 3px 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .footer-notes li::before {
            content: "· ";
        }

        .status-footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 14px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #A0AEC0;
        }
        .status-footer .status-pass { color: #38A169; font-weight: 600; }
        .status-footer .status-attention { color: #D69E2E; font-weight: 600; }
        .status-footer .status-error { color: #E53E3E; font-weight: 600; }

        .disclaimer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #CBD5E0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

    <!-- 页面头部 -->
    <div class="header">
        <div class="icon">🪙</div>
        <h1>金银铜锡价格月报</h1>
        <div class="month-badge">{{ year }}年{{ month_name }}月</div>
        <div class="report-date">报告日期：{{ report_date }}</div>
    </div>

    <!-- 一句话总览 -->
    <div class="overview-line">
        {{ overview_line }}
    </div>

    <!-- 本月涨跌重点 -->
    <div class="highlight-row">
        {% if top_gainer %}
        <div class="highlight-card">
            <div class="label">📈 涨幅最高</div>
            <div class="metal-name">{{ top_gainer.metal_cn }}</div>
            <div class="chg-value up">+{{ "%.2f"|format(top_gainer.chg_1m) }}%</div>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if top_loser %}
        <div class="highlight-card">
            <div class="label">📉 跌幅最大</div>
            <div class="metal-name">{{ top_loser.metal_cn }}</div>
            <div class="chg-value down">{{ "%.2f"|format(top_loser.chg_1m) }}%</div>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>

    <!-- 四种金属卡片 -->
    <div class="section-title">🔍 四种金属情况</div>

    {% for m in metals %}
    <div class="metal-card">
        <div class="card-header">
            <span class="metal-title">
                {% if m.metal_cn == "黄金" %}🥇{% elif m.metal_cn == "白银" %}🥈{% elif m.metal_cn == "铜" %}🟠{% elif m.metal_cn == "锡" %}🛢️{% endif %}
                {{ m.metal_cn }}
            </span>
            <span class="status-tag
                {% if m.status in ('上涨明显',) %}tag-strong-up
                {% elif m.status in ('温和上涨', '持续上涨') %}tag-cont-up
                {% elif m.status in ('变化不大',) %}tag-flat
                {% elif m.status in ('小幅回落', '持续下跌') %}tag-cont-down
                {% elif m.status in ('下跌明显',) %}tag-strong-down
                {% else %}tag-flat
                {% endif %}
            ">{{ m.status }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="price-line">
            <span class="price-main">{{ m.price }}</span>
            <span class="price-unit">{{ m.unit }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="changes">
            <div class="change-item">
                <span class="chg-label">比上月</span>
                <span class="chg-val {% if m.chg_1m is not none and m.chg_1m > 0 %}up{% elif m.chg_1m is not none and m.chg_1m < 0 %}down{% else %}flat{% endif %}">
                    {% if m.chg_1m is not none %}
                        {% if m.chg_1m >= 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ "%.2f"|format(m.chg_1m) }}%
                    {% else %}-{% endif %}
                </span>
            </div>
            <div class="change-item">
                <span class="chg-label">近三个月</span>
                <span class="chg-val {% if m.chg_3m is not none and m.chg_3m > 0 %}up{% elif m.chg_3m is not none and m.chg_3m < 0 %}down{% else %}flat{% endif %}">
                    {% if m.chg_3m is not none %}
                        {% if m.chg_3m >= 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ "%.2f"|format(m.chg_3m) }}%
                    {% else %}-{% endif %}
                </span>
            </div>
            <div class="change-item">
                <span class="chg-label">近半年</span>
                <span class="chg-val {% if m.chg_6m is not none and m.chg_6m > 0 %}up{% elif m.chg_6m is not none and m.chg_6m < 0 %}down{% else %}flat{% endif %}">
                    {% if m.chg_6m is not none %}
                        {% if m.chg_6m >= 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ "%.2f"|format(m.chg_6m) }}%
                    {% else %}-{% endif %}
                </span>
            </div>
            <div class="change-item">
                <span class="chg-label">近一年</span>
                <span class="chg-val {% if m.chg_12m is not none and m.chg_12m > 0 %}up{% elif m.chg_12m is not none and m.chg_12m < 0 %}down{% else %}flat{% endif %}">
                    {% if m.chg_12m is not none %}
                        {% if m.chg_12m >= 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ "%.2f"|format(m.chg_12m) }}%
                    {% else %}-{% endif %}
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <!-- 图表区域 -->
    {% if has_trend_chart %}
    <div class="section-title">📊 近一年价格走势</div>
    <div class="chart-section">
        <img src="{{ trend_chart_src }}" alt="近一年价格累计涨跌幅走势">
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if has_bar_chart %}
    <div class="section-title">📊 本月涨跌幅对比</div>
    <div class="chart-section">
        <img src="{{ bar_chart_src }}" alt="本月涨跌幅对比">
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <!-- 贵金属与工业金属对比 -->
    <div class="section-title">⚖️ 贵金属和工业金属对比</div>
    <div class="compare-box">
        <div class="compare-row">
            <span class="compare-label">贵金属（金、银）</span>
            <span class="compare-val {% if precious_avg is not none and precious_avg > 0 %}up{% elif precious_avg is not none and precious_avg < 0 %}down{% else %}flat{% endif %}">
                {% if precious_avg is not none %}
                    {% if precious_avg >= 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ "%.2f"|format(precious_avg) }}%
                {% else %}-{% endif %}
            </span>
        </div>
        <div class="compare-row">
            <span class="compare-label">工业金属（铜、锡）</span>
            <span class="compare-val {% if industrial_avg is not none and industrial_avg > 0 %}up{% elif industrial_avg is not none and industrial_avg < 0 %}down{% else %}flat{% endif %}">
                {% if industrial_avg is not none %}
                    {% if industrial_avg >= 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ "%.2f"|format(industrial_avg) }}%
                {% else %}-{% endif %}
            </span>
        </div>
        <div class="compare-sentence">
            💡 {{ comparison_sentence }}
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 本月提醒 -->
    <div class="section-title">🔔 本月提醒</div>
    <div class="alert-box">
        {% if has_alerts %}
            {% for alert in alerts %}
                <div class="alert-item">{{ alert }}</div>
            {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
            <div class="no-alert">✅ 本月未发现明显异常波动。</div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>

    <!-- 本月小结 -->
    <div class="section-title">📝 本月小结</div>
    <div class="summary-box">
        {% for bullet in summary_bullets %}
            <div class="summary-item">{{ bullet }}</div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <!-- 数据说明 -->
    <div class="section-title">📋 数据说明</div>
    <div class="footer-notes">
        <ul>
            <li>本报告使用世界银行发布的月度大宗商品价格数据。</li>
            <li>原始价格为美元计价，已按当月平均美元兑人民币汇率换算为人民币参考价。</li>
            <li>黄金、白银单位：元/克。铜、锡单位：元/吨。</li>
            <li>本报告反映的是月度平均价格变化，不是实时交易价格。</li>
            <li>仅用于了解价格趋势，不作为投资建议。</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- 数据状态 -->
    <div class="status-footer">
        🌐 数据来源：世界银行商品市场粉单 · 校验状态：
        <span class="{% if validation_status == '正常' %}status-pass{% elif validation_status == '需关注' %}status-attention{% else %}status-error{% endif %}">
            {{ validation_status }}
        </span>
    </div>

    <!-- 免责声明 -->
    <div class="disclaimer">
        价格数据可能存在延迟。报告内容仅供参考，不构成任何投资建议。<br>
        投资有风险，决策需谨慎。
    </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
